Extraction preamble:

```spl
index=<index>
| spath <path.to.id>    output=<id>
| spath <path.to.value> output=<value>
| eval v=tonumber(<value>)
```

<Note type traps: numbers stored as strings, units that differ between
sources (kW vs W), non-numeric sentinel values like "unknown".>

## Time windows

| Window | Use |
|---|---|
| <YYYY-MM-DD → YYYY-MM-DD> | <Main analysis window> |
| <YYYY-MM-DD → YYYY-MM-DD> | **Gap — no data.** |

**Always use absolute time ranges.** A relative range like `-24h` can land in a
gap and render empty panels.

