## Rules for the agent

- Validate every panel search against the instance and report its row count
  before building the dashboard around it.
- Never write to Splunk (REST, app install, saved searches) without asking first.
- No alert actions that notify people (email, webhook) unless explicitly asked.
- Prefer summary rollups; stop and ask before any search expected to run > 60s.
